wgf-autopilot 1
# Tire smoke (written by hand): from the grid, a wheelspinning start and a handbrake turn
# under full throttle, then everything let go. The rear tires' slip makes smoke while they
# spin and slide (racer.smoke_rate, puffs a second; racer.smoke, the puffs alive), and once
# they grip again every puff dies within its life (1.8 s at most). Also the case
# tools/frames.py --autopilot slide measures: the most smoke a car makes.
seed 1
at 1 wait racer.state >= 1
at 2 expect racer.smoke == 0
at 10 key down up
at 11 expect racer.state == 2
at 200 expect racer.state == 3
at 250 expect racer.smoke_rate > 0
at 250 expect racer.smoke > 0
at 300 key down left
at 300 key down space
at 360 expect racer.slip > 2
at 360 expect racer.smoke_rate > 0
at 380 screenshot slide
at 400 expect racer.smoke >= 100
at 400 key up space
at 400 key up left
at 400 key up up
at 560 expect racer.smoke_rate == 0
at 560 expect racer.smoke == 0
at 560 expect racer.recoveries == 0
at 560 end
